' The automated pass reads data members and little else. It leaves a class
' whose content is methods as an empty box, it drops the two sink backends
' because their base clause wraps onto a second line, and it cannot see a
' free function at all. The blocks below fill those boxes, draw the
' relationships, and name the free functions. They redeclare fully
' qualified classes instead of reopening a namespace, because this PlantUML
' version refuses a namespace that already holds classes; a redeclaration
' merges its members into the box the automated pass drew.

