    +context() : const span_context&
    +get_trace_id() : const trace_id&
    +get_span_id() : const span_id&
    +get_resource() : const resource&
    +resource_ptr() : shared_ptr<resource>
    +start_span(name : string_view, kind : span_kind) : pair<telemetry_context, span>
    +start_linked_trace(name : string_view, kind : span_kind) : pair<telemetry_context, span>
    +is_valid() : bool
}
note right of "ores::telemetry::domain::telemetry_context"
Immutable context passed as an explicit parameter, so the
trace travels through the call chain without ambient state.
start_span makes a child in the same trace; start_linked_trace
makes a new trace that links back to this span.
end note

