note right of "ores::telemetry::exporting::telemetry_configuration"
The only type left in exporting. It builds the
boost::program_options entry for the telemetry flags and reads
them back. The JSON Lines exporters, the upload position
tracker and the log macros are deleted, so nothing here opens a
file or forwards a record any more.
end note

